    "text": "For the reaction:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math><br /><br />The reduction potential is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#959;</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>RT</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced></mfrac></math><br /><br />From the given data <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>14</mn></math> and<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.0</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>10</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></msup></math>, we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.0</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>10</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.0</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>10</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=0.34</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.059</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.0</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>10</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.34</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.059</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>59</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>"
